      <p source="#source-255-266"><seg source="#source-255-266">こきり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-266-298"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266-281"><rb>葭</rb><rt>よし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281-298">がゆれても</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-298-315"><seg source="#source-298-315">とびだすな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-315-338"><seg source="#source-315-338">なんでもないぞ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-338-351"><seg source="#source-338-351">河風だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-351-365"><seg source="#source-351-365">よしきり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-365-376"><seg source="#source-365-376">こきり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-376-405"><seg source="#source-376-405">葭の笛をふいてみせ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-405-434"><seg source="#source-405-434">葭の笛ができたらば</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-434-448"><seg source="#source-434-448">おらにも</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-448-469"><seg source="#source-448-469">一つくれないか</seg></p>
